{"id":"634486","name":"金枪鱼蔬菜沙拉","author":"大蜜呀v","authorId":"36318","desc":"","cover":"images/634486/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"金枪鱼罐头","amount":"1盒"},{"name":"球生菜","amount":"半颗"},{"name":"西红柿","amount":"2个"}],"sub":[{"name":"甜沙拉酱","amount":"两大勺"},{"name":"蕃茄酱","amount":"1勺"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"球生菜洗净用厨房用纸擦干水分。","img":"images/634486/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"把西红柿切窄片沿着碗沿码齐。","img":"images/634486/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"甜沙拉酱加番茄沙司拌匀。","img":"images/634486/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"将沙拉酱摊在生菜上面。","img":"images/634486/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"撒黑胡椒。","img":"images/634486/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"金枪鱼罐头沥干汤水。","img":"images/634486/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放在酱料上面。","img":"images/634486/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"撒黑胡椒和罗勒碎，一起吃沙拉吧！","img":"images/634486/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}